                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "height": "fit_content",
                  "content": "有细分品类的一级品类不能删除；被供应商主营产品使用的细分品类不能删除，只能停用。",
                  "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
                  "fontSize": 12.0,
                  "fontWeight": 400,
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "fill": [
